course: dictionary
lesson: 13066
title: Words about animals
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words name a whole group of animals. «Feline» is one of them. It means to do with cats or the cat family. The cat family includes house cats, lions, tigers, leopards and cheetahs. Context helps: «The vet checked the feline's teeth and claws» tells you the vet was looking at a cat, so feline must mean to do with cats.
explain: Feline can also describe how someone moves. «She crossed the room with feline grace, quiet and smooth, and nobody heard her step.» Graceful means moving in a smooth, pretty way, so feline grace is the quiet, smooth way a cat moves. Ask yourself: would the sentence still make sense if I swapped in "cat-like"? If it does, you have found the meaning.
explain: Words for animal groups often come in pairs. «Canine» is the matching word for dogs, and «feline» is the word for cats. If you know one of them, you can often guess the other. A check of the words around it will tell you whether feline is describing something or naming an animal.
fact: «Feline» means to do with cats or the cat family.
fact: The cat family includes house cats, lions, tigers, leopards and cheetahs.
fact: «Feline» can also be a noun: a feline is a cat or any animal of the cat family.
fact: Felines are meat-eating mammals with sharp claws and whiskers.
fact: «Canine» is the matching word for dogs.
exercise: «The feline stretched out in the sun and purred.» What is the feline in this sentence? | A bird | A dog | A horse | *A cat
exercise: «She crossed the stage with feline grace, quiet and smooth.» What does feline grace mean? | Very fast running | Angry shouting | Loud and clumsy stomping | *Smooth, quiet movement like a cat
exercise: Which word means to do with dogs? | Lion | Feline | Cheetah | *Canine
test: «The vet read the notes about feline health.» What does feline health mean? | The health of fish | The health of birds | The health of trees | *The health of cats
test: Which animal is part of the cat family? | A goat | *A cheetah | A horse | A cow
exam: Which is the best meaning of feline as a noun? | *A cat or any animal of the cat family | A bird that sings | A small fish | A dog or a wolf
